    "定时运行系统自带的 nettop（后台每 8 秒，界面打开时每 2 秒，单次约 17ms），记录各应用流量与 60 分钟历史，并在后台检测异常。关闭后网络页与告警停止更新。" : {
      "comment" : "网络页后台网络监控开关下方的说明",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Periodically runs the built-in nettop (every 8 seconds in the background, every 2 seconds while the interface is open, about 17 ms each time), records each app's traffic and 60 minutes of history, and detects anomalies in the background. When this is off, the Network page and alerts stop updating."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
